{"id":"91a23fe6cd503a7d","group":"18","path":"18/18-thm-prewellordering-characterization.md","title":"预良序的无序数关系刻画","display":"thm-prewellordering-characterization — 预良序的无序数关系刻画","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-thm-prewellordering-characterization","aliases":["18-thm-prewellordering-characterization"],"display":"thm-prewellordering-characterization — 预良序的无序数关系刻画","depends_on":["[[18-df-prewellordering]]"],"source_work":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity (Springer, 2009)","source_section":"Theorem 13.2.3; Lemma 13.2.4","source_printed_pages":"338–339","source_pdf_pages":"346–347","verification_status":"source-statement-and-proof-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_review":"已核 Theorem 13.2.3、Lemma 13.2.4 的全部所列证明；反向以商良序展开原书的局部序型"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-thm-prewellordering-characterization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-thm-prewellordering-characterization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-prewellordering-characterization — 预良序的无序数关系刻画"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b8684802726abc97\" href=\"?note=b8684802726abc97\" title=\"18-df-prewellordering\">18-df-prewellordering</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_work","html":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity (Springer, 2009)"},{"key":"source_section","html":"Theorem 13.2.3; Lemma 13.2.4"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"338–339"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"346–347"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-proof-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_review","html":"已核 Theorem 13.2.3、Lemma 13.2.4 的全部所列证明；反向以商良序展开原书的局部序型"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>在 ZFC 元理论中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(P\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,S\\subseteq\\omega^2\">\\(R,S\\subseteq\\omega^2\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PreWO}_\\omega\">\\(\\operatorname{PreWO}_\\omega\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b8684802726abc97\" href=\"?note=b8684802726abc97\" title=\"18-df-prewellordering\">18-df-prewellordering</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tr}_\\omega\">\\(\\mathrm{Tr}_\\omega\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Wf}_\\omega\">\\(\\mathrm{Wf}_\\omega\\)</span> 分别由下式定义传递性与良基性。后者量化全部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 的子集；本节点是元理论命题，随后在弱二阶对象理论中使用同形公式时，需要保留该理论的集合量词解释。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tr}_\\omega(R)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall x,y,z\\in\\omega\\;\n[(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle y,z\\rangle\\in R)\n\\to\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in R].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Tr}_\\omega(R)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall x,y,z\\in\\omega\\;\n[(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle y,z\\rangle\\in R)\n\\to\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in R].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Wf}_\\omega(S)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall A\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\;\n[A\\ne\\varnothing\\to\n\\exists x\\in A\\;\\forall y\\in A\\;(\\langle y,x\\rangle\\notin S)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Wf}_\\omega(S)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall A\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\;\n[A\\ne\\varnothing\\to\n\\exists x\\in A\\;\\forall y\\in A\\;(\\langle y,x\\rangle\\notin S)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{PreWO}_\\omega(P,R,S)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;&amp;\n\\mathrm{Tr}_\\omega(R)\\land\\mathrm{Tr}_\\omega(S)\n\\land\\mathrm{Wf}_\\omega(S)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y\\in\\omega\\;\n[\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\leftrightarrow\nx\\in P\\land(y\\notin P\\lor\\langle y,x\\rangle\\notin S)]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y\\in\\omega\\;\n[\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in S\\leftrightarrow\n(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle y,x\\rangle\\notin R)].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{PreWO}_\\omega(P,R,S)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;&amp;\n\\mathrm{Tr}_\\omega(R)\\land\\mathrm{Tr}_\\omega(S)\n\\land\\mathrm{Wf}_\\omega(S)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y\\in\\omega\\;\n[\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\leftrightarrow\nx\\in P\\land(y\\notin P\\lor\\langle y,x\\rangle\\notin S)]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y\\in\\omega\\;\n[\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in S\\leftrightarrow\n(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle y,x\\rangle\\notin R)].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PreWO}_\\omega(P,R,S)\\to\nP=\\{x\\in\\omega\\mid\\langle x,x\\rangle\\in R\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PreWO}_\\omega(P,R,S)\\to\nP=\\{x\\in\\omega\\mid\\langle x,x\\rangle\\in R\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第一组等价式把 Theorem 13.2.3 的“两个关系传递”的假设显式并入右侧，所以没有藏在 Remark 中；最后一式是 Lemma 13.2.4。无序数刻画的右侧只量化数、数的集合与给定关系。</p>\n<p>已核原书陈述及 p.338–339 所列证明。正向由范数比较得传递性、两个比较公理；无限下降会诱导序数下降，故严格关系良基。反向由良基性得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg xSx\">\\(\\neg xSx\\)</span>，再由第一个公理得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 上反身；两个公理使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 上全预序。按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"xEy\\leftrightarrow xRy\\land yRx\">\\(xEy\\leftrightarrow xRy\\land yRx\\)</span> 取商，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 在商上诱导严格良序。其唯一序数序型提供从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 满射到该序数的范数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 外元素由第一个公理及第二个公理同时放在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 内元素之后，由此恢复定义中的两个全域比较式。这展开了原书写作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{otyp}_{\\prec}(x)\">\\(\\operatorname{otyp}_{\\prec}(x)\\)</span> 的局部商序型，未把有等价元素的关系直接当作反对称良序。</p>\n<p>对角等式直接由第一个公理与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg xSx\">\\(\\neg xSx\\)</span> 得到。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P=\\varnothing\">\\(P=\\varnothing\\)</span> 时，比较公理强制 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R=S=\\varnothing\">\\(R=S=\\varnothing\\)</span>，与空范数版本相容。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-prewellordering","status":"resolved","id":"b8684802726abc97","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-prewellordering]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-prewellordering","status":"resolved","id":"b8684802726abc97","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"在 ZFC 元理论中，$P\\subseteq\\omega$，$R,S\\subseteq\\omega^2$；$\\operatorname{PreWO}_\\omega$ 取 [[18-df-prewellordering]]。$\\mathrm{Tr}_\\omega$ 与 $\\mathrm{Wf}_\\omega$ 分别由下式定义传递性与良基性。后者量化全部 $\\omega$ 的子集；本节点是元理论命题，随后在弱二阶对象理论中使用同形公式时，需要保留该理论的集合量词解释。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"P\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"R,S\\subseteq\\omega^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PreWO}_\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Tr}_\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Wf}_\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Tr}_\\omega(R)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall x,y,z\\in\\omega\\;\n[(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle y,z\\rangle\\in R)\n\\to\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in R].","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Wf}_\\omega(S)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall A\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\;\n[A\\ne\\varnothing\\to\n\\exists x\\in A\\;\\forall y\\in A\\;(\\langle y,x\\rangle\\notin S)].","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{PreWO}_\\omega(P,R,S)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;&\n\\mathrm{Tr}_\\omega(R)\\land\\mathrm{Tr}_\\omega(S)\n\\land\\mathrm{Wf}_\\omega(S)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x,y\\in\\omega\\;\n[\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\leftrightarrow\nx\\in P\\land(y\\notin P\\lor\\langle y,x\\rangle\\notin S)]\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x,y\\in\\omega\\;\n[\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in S\\leftrightarrow\n(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle y,x\\rangle\\notin R)].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PreWO}_\\omega(P,R,S)\\to\nP=\\{x\\in\\omega\\mid\\langle x,x\\rangle\\in R\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg xSx","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"xEy\\leftrightarrow xRy\\land yRx","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{otyp}_{\\prec}(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg xSx","display":false},{"tex":"P=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"R=S=\\varnothing","display":false}],"bytes":3181,"backlinks":[{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-142","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-thm-prewellordering-characterization]]"},{"id":"100d7af02276fe1b","anchor":"ref-91","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-thm-prewellordering-characterization]]"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-134","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-thm-prewellordering-characterization]]"},{"id":"bf01645e59119446","anchor":"ref-143","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-thm-prewellordering-characterization|18-thm-prewellordering-characterization]]"}],"outgoing":["b8684802726abc97"]}